msgid "Cylindrical Fence"
msgstr "圆柱形围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:9
#: 16b185163f2b4a5eb4bbd16b52d461b4 20e47c36432048f984220669449b729e
#: 7373a98bd0f54f6abe3e697f606c62ba b0e5b676d9664b5fb9ce8f4e0c8bd55a
#: e191a9dd7f444b2ba6aafc031e212ad0
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:11
#: 344f12aa27ae434b926989825a626601 37af04ee913d4b44854b0e3d574387f7
#: 4161a391f52f4739b77c67b955f960fe a07d10a65cbf41c8af1566b23a8d9b89
#: bf6cd43fed584606bbf1b1f5f9e35d3f
msgid ""
"ArduPilot includes a simple \"tin can\" shaped fence centered on home that "
"will attempt to stop your copter/rover from flying/driving too far away by "
"stopping at the fence in some Copter/Rover modes if :ref:`common-object-"
"avoidance-landing-page` is setup."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 包含一个以 Home 点为中心的简单「锡罐」形围栏，当 :ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page` 已设置时，将在某些 Copter/Rover 模式下于围栏处停止，以防止飞行器/地面车辆飞/行驶得太远。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:13
#: 061ac3d634f746b48ddadff26d6fb50a 3d836f48ba104b0f92a0cdf18a165423
#: 50e4725542684128977e8711e933d499 66edfd94bb7b4d8ab19726bae7a1590d
#: efa98199f49f435f8fad69eb17c2bde0
msgid ""
"The maximum circular distance and altitude (altitude used by Plane and "
"Copter only) and the vehicle behavior when the fence is reached can be "
"configured using a ground station like Mission Planner or QGC."
msgstr ""
"最大圆形距离和高度（高度仅适用于 Plane 和 Copter）以及飞行器到达围栏时的行为，可通过 Mission Planner 或 QGC "
"等地面站进行配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:15
#: 03062a59626741d9b768495848fa938b 0d4dbd03c90247b9bbce227511979c4b
#: 7e413f29e9d5472cbe5bea9ce45e77b1 87d22340b55e425289ae4672bee71069
#: a584802665d348d489c415ba7a27a555
msgid ""
"See :ref:`common-geofencing-landing-page` for fence setup parameters common "
"to all fences. Setup specific to the Cylindrical fence is below."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`common-geofencing-landing-page` 了解所有围栏通用的设置参数。圆柱形围栏的特定设置如下。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:18
#: 40c5f44d925b4325a6581853db1ed645 895be448ee1a499fb31fd2d969f5cfba
#: abf4134c5cbb4a81abdff485e04f868f d6d06d18b2844b39b3e1d4d2b5bd052f
#: e4145e38477d4056a4aa917cf7205721
msgid "Enabling the Cylindrical Fence in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中启用圆柱形围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:20
#: 4b847e7c1ffb469b8055857aaca8c7d5 76d711e2af6d4468afb38e77d1ef3a4f
#: 8d85266e2e754d52a4f77381a7333476 98f5ebf6df6e40a3a35b905dc40553d5
#: bc8b1233b3d741eb82e0f2ca0d3d721e
msgid ""
"To enable Fences, go to the Mission Planner full parameter list "
"(CONFIG->Full Parameter Tree), search for items with ``FENCE_``:"
msgstr ""
"要启用围栏，请进入 Mission Planner 完整参数列表（CONFIG->Full Parameter Tree），搜索含 ``FENCE_``"
" 的项目："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:26
#: 071355d62fd542d99fabd46ff1ad2dcf 2c513f1ab83f4fd3bc273cbd77ed97aa
#: 8a456f7215ad46ada4c964785aa2d1d4 a55f36a5c9084238b335deefe72a410b
#: fd7ff98bf56846d78d588b5deecdf47c
msgid "Parameter associated with Cylindrical Fence"
msgstr "圆柱形围栏相关参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:27
#: 1156d527072a48b193f9686aa51202d0 26b0670b1fd84e8fb287ee4e93b7e024
#: 4f0fdb9bb69a442b9284a89784b19f5c 8f47359e378b4896b29d9b8ca01a6021
#: ad40238cfd184785becd48f88776efef
msgid "Set :ref:`FENCE_TYPE<FENCE_TYPE>` bit 1 to \"1\"(+ 2 to value)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`FENCE_TYPE<FENCE_TYPE>` 第 1 位设为 「1」（值 +2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:28
#: 326a5cd7090b4db5a5cef22e9f05627b 98f11928810b402fb9437c5e1f82b694
#: bceef7ffaf2940aebaf0ffb0e2bbacaf ccbbafa355934b8fbda855135847e931
#: e6a042267f8f4f2a848ad4392c59aa08
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FENCE_RADIUS<FENCE_RADIUS>` to the maximum distance from HOME you "
"want (in meters). This should normally be at least 50m. This value must be "
"larger than :ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` and greater than 30m."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FENCE_RADIUS<FENCE_RADIUS>` 设为距 Home 点的最大距离（单位：米），通常建议至少 50m。该值必须大于 "
":ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` 且大于 30m。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:30
#: 22ab2a0a3cc44c6f8a0f77d19c4851a1 29090a49fdfd4c92becceacdfea59b9d
#: c818e9f655734a488092f5922c7356f8 e437a943abbd4fdbadcf735c19807177
#: ed9ca66d9b8d471693a7c438e3ec9a8d
msgid ""
"Polygon :ref:`FENCE_TYPE<FENCE_TYPE>` fences includes circular fences, as "
"well as polygonal shapes, as specified in the Inclusion/Exclusion fence "
"list. This simple home centered \"TINCAN\" fence is a separate fence. Rover "
"ignores altitudes, if set."
msgstr ""
"多边形 :ref:`FENCE_TYPE<FENCE_TYPE>` 围栏包含圆形围栏以及在包含/排除围栏列表中指定的多边形形状。这个以 Home "
"为中心的简单「锡罐」围栏是独立的围栏。Rover 会忽略设定的高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:36
#: 34a31aca84bb48d699e00ca39f735dea 4d56603ca24340b8a13ad73ec9d5659b
#: ab05853b55e5414b8e83a09e1dc0f91f ae33a2d2138242358e0853d1db56e262
#: dd5b31cf339249f6addb269f0cdd395d
msgid "Copter GeoFence Tab"
msgstr "Copter 电子围栏标签页"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:38
#: 089091ac4d4a4b0c9ac4e8f275bc0d4e 106ae37dc7d244c98772e3c2dda70eb8
#: 355bcd73a4774438907492291748be83 46398cc06ec542e69baeb8ecf2a13d5a
#: c372d0206e78482f97a938664d565e51
msgid ""
"Copter and Traditional Heli , when connected to Mission Planner, present a "
"CONFIG tab called GeoFence which provides another way to access these "
"parameters in those vehicles."
msgstr ""
"Copter 和传统直升机在连接 Mission Planner 后，CONFIG 标签页中会出现 GeoFence "
"子页，提供另一种访问这些参数的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:44
#: 2838739361ae4bf187df62c8ef8cb75f 647705f329fc40518fb81098c1057f70
#: 7532198d4ad74178ae0a304dd19ff812 903c100cf21d4ec493e43c634be01ac8
#: db0e2cc685594c1da49498a303e45dff
msgid "Warnings:"
msgstr "警告："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:46
#: 11d19f196e6b48d4a1003fa0d8d9087c 7487e73a0eca41c9a6bdf59979c752e0
#: c04705be61fd4eeea6f86c9381ad385a d471ba34f93c40c8b8176dfac50a7f03
#: e715341c5605498f9af0bd9bc2d81f65
msgid "The minimum recommended cylindrical fence radius is 30m"
msgstr "圆柱形围栏的最小推荐半径为 30m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:47
#: 0301f561b4d64fa7b2e25f116b7feed7 84eeb4b8ab6c49798cfcf122dccac486
#: c18627b114644b08ad2c63072b3600e7 c41cb7e5368f4bd18e20a0e1e043b3a6
#: d77f165913fc4001a9f91783dd8919d2
msgid ""
"The fence requires the GPS to be functioning well so do not disable the "
":ref:`GPS arming check <common-prearm-safety-checks>` nor the :ref:`EKF "
"failsafe <ekf-inav-failsafe>` while the fence is enabled. Conversely, if you"
" disable either of these checks, disable the Fence."
msgstr ""
"围栏需要 GPS 正常工作，因此在启用围栏时，请勿禁用 :ref:`GPS 解锁检查 <common-prearm-safety-checks>` 或 "
":ref:`EKF 失控保护 <ekf-inav-failsafe>`。反之，如果禁用了上述任一检查，请同时禁用围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:48
#: 05b564f2f33f4ed1ac1fc9f0b36e7010 19e5ab5932a94fde8a6205f806c69c8f
#: 32e3d4029d3c4d2890c8bd9a8074a8a3 98bd9cb2a134497589e0c9d8756be9ea
#: ac7844ff4c674fae9d19bb0841cb62d1
msgid "For the best results, ensure RTL is working on your vehicle."
msgstr "为获得最佳效果，请确保您的飞行器 RTL 功能正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:49
#: 13af280a3dce4e15bfa7e4b41e347b68 610f5089ad1142fe8872e00c863da9f7
#: 6478e2779d6e4679871bbcdec641ef22 6ef37de4a5d24a8ca61465a88664b8b3
#: d1ccb5767e0946fa881a84cad5b8c6ec
msgid ""
"With the Fence enabled in Copter and Rover, the pre-arm checks will require "
"you have GPS lock before arming the vehicle."
msgstr "在 Copter 和 Rover 中启用围栏后，预解锁检查将要求在解锁前获得 GPS 定位锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:51
#: 52b3b5eee02b4073970a3f8f6e410eb9 606cb4782521466d92429ac6a3bf96f0
#: b1a78ae75b534c91999dc8fe18b296b0 b4cf333fdd154ba3aa146f943c8f1d99
#: e8421fb9970d456b8e5ee1cd6ad87556
msgid ""
"In Copter, if EKF failsafe occurs and the Fence is enabled and you lose GPS "
"lock while flying the fence will be disabled."
msgstr "在 Copter 中，如果发生 EKF 失控保护且围栏已启用，在飞行过程中失去 GPS 定位时，围栏将被禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:53
#: 1a0b27d2ca0845ea8cb500aad5afc715 2b1b320382cd4c15adb94bb4018f0d50
#: 773d7a5b16fd4b2c9bd94b301b681cb5 c436461444f1483b9c122c5f1d685e60
#: db12eac60aaf4c2c95408a66c41a813c
msgid ""
"In Copter, if EKF failsafe occurs and the Fence is enabled and in an "
"autonomous mode, the vehicle will switch to LAND (HOLD for Rover) because we"
" no longer know the vehicle position and we want to ensure the vehicle never"
" travels far outside the fence. If this is not desired, the pilot can retake"
" control by moving the flight mode switch to a manual mode."
msgstr ""
"在 Copter 中，如果发生 EKF 失控保护且围栏已启用并处于自主模式，飞行器将切换到 Land 模式（Rover 为 "
"HOLD），因为我们不再知道飞行器位置，并希望确保飞行器不会飞到围栏外太远。如果不希望这样，飞手可以将飞行模式开关切换到手动模式以重新接管控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ac2_simple_geofence.rst:57
#: 29d6af55be44406f9c28537c75d83714 57bc28081f404c80a97155b50bd7a653
#: 61c054d925554ac98ed8259592717a92 bb9bf9d5e306414d9758a8ed88b49988
#: bc2244ac5ed7454fad4582bbe4f40133
msgid ""
"The Copter and Rover backup fences are created 20m out from the previous "
"breached fence not 20m out from the vehicle's position.  This means if you "
"choose to override the fence you may have less than 20m to regain vehicle "
"control before the fence switches the vehicle to the "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` again.  If you really want to override the"
" fence, you should be ready to switch the flight mode twice or alternatively"
" set-up the enable/disable fence switch."
msgstr ""
"Copter 和 Rover 的备用围栏在上一次被突破的围栏外 20m 处创建，而非在飞行器当前位置外 20m "
"处。这意味着如果选择覆盖围栏，您可能拥有不足 20m 的距离来重新获得飞行器控制，之后围栏将再次切换飞行器至 "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>`。如果确实需要覆盖围栏，应准备好切换飞行模式两次，或设置围栏启用/禁用开关。"

